{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["<b>And he shall have power over the treasures of</b> — the Targum [renders]: 'and what he did not hunt.' And perhaps it is from the root of darkmonim. The Cushites — they are adjacent to Egypt; they will be in the marches of the king of the north, that they will turn to his dominion."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {0 "The Targum citation 'ואשר לא צדה' is hyper-literal and obscure; translated as found without smoothing."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:21:21.463402143Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}